---
title: Checkout flow
---
%%{init: {"flowchart": {"curve": "basis"}}}%%
flowchart LR
  %% Customer-facing entry points
  start([Customer opens cart]) --> cart[Review cart]
  cart --> signedIn{Signed in?}
  signedIn -->|no| login(Log in or continue as guest)
  signedIn -->|yes| address[/Shipping address/]
  login --> address

  subgraph pay [Payment]
    direction TB
    method{{Choose method}} --> card[Card] & wallet[Wallet]
    card -- 3-D Secure --> psp[[Payment provider]]
    wallet --> psp
    psp -.->|webhook| ledger[(Ledger)]
  end

  address --> method
  psp ==> ok{Approved?}
  ok -->|yes| confirm>Order confirmed]
  ok -->|no| retry((Retry)) --> method
  confirm --> notify & invoice

  subgraph after [After the order]
    notify[Email receipt]
    invoice[\Invoice PDF\]
    warehouse[(Warehouse)]
  end

  invoice --- warehouse
  notify --o archive[Archive]
  ledger --x fraud[Fraud check]
  fraud <--> ledger
  confirm ~~~ archive

  classDef hot fill:#f96,stroke:#333
  class ok,retry hot
  style psp stroke-width:2px
  linkStyle 0 stroke:#999
  click cart "https://example.com/cart" "Open cart"
  cart:::hot
